# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter 10 — Conseil européen
script council_borrell
  say "Diplomat" "Josep Borrell, the former High Representative, said in 2022: “Europe is a garden, the rest of the world is a jungle.” It caused… a bit of a stir."
end
script council_merkel
  if flag COUNCIL_MERKEL goto fin
  show R merkel neutral
  say "Angela Merkel" "Sixteen years as chancellor. Hundreds of summits. In 2015, I said: “Wir schaffen das” — we can do this."
  expr R happy
  say "Angela Merkel" "But can you do it? I'm the first member of the Council. Nobody gets past without a compromise."
  close
  hide all
  battle merkel
  setflag COUNCIL_MERKEL
  show R merkel happy
  say "Angela Merkel" "Wir haben es geschafft. You may pass. Mario is waiting for you… with a 400-page report."
:fin
end
script council_draghi
  if flag COUNCIL_DRAGHI goto fin
  show R draghi neutral
  say "Mario Draghi" "July 2012, London. I said three words: “Whatever it takes”. The euro was saved. The markets calmed down."
  say "Mario Draghi" "In 2024, my report on competitiveness called for up to 800 billion of investment a year. Invest in this debate."
  close
  hide all
  battle draghi
  setflag COUNCIL_DRAGHI
  show R draghi happy
  say "Mario Draghi" "You did whatever it took. Kaja Kallas is waiting for you. She's… very direct."
:fin
end
script council_kallas
  if flag COUNCIL_KALLAS goto fin
  show R kallas neutral
  say "Kaja Kallas" "High Representative for Foreign Affairs since December 2024. Former Prime Minister of Estonia."
  say "Kaja Kallas" "The world is dangerous. I need to know whether you can stand up to the great powers. Show me."
  close
  hide all
  battle kallas
  setflag COUNCIL_KALLAS
  show R kallas happy
  say "Kaja Kallas" "Solid. You'll need it. President Costa is waiting for you. He hopes to finish before midnight."
:fin
end
script council_costa
  if flag COUNCIL_COSTA goto fin
  show R costa happy
  say "António Costa" "President of the European Council since December 2024! It's 11:54 p.m. If we finish before midnight, it'll be a historic first."
  say "António Costa" "But first: all the heads of state have fallen asleep around the table. Help me wake them up! Blow into the microphone… or tap the screen!"
  close
  minigame sommet
  show R costa worried
  say "António Costa" "It's… 4:37 a.m. Well. As usual. Let's debate anyway."
  close
  hide all
  battle costa
  setflag COUNCIL_COSTA
  setflag COUNCIL_DONE
  show R costa happy
  say "António Costa" "The European Council approves your application unanimously! Well… unanimously minus one constructive abstention."
  say "António Costa" "The President of the Commission is waiting for you on the 13th floor of the Berlaymont. It's the last step before the directive."
:fin
end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Champion
script michel_berlaymont
  if flag CINE_SOFAGATE goto vu
  setflag CINE_SOFAGATE
  call cine_sofagate
:vu
  show R michel sulk
  say "Charles Michel" "Ah, hello. I'm Charles Michel, former President of the European Council. I'm just… sitting. On the only chair."
  say "Charles Michel" "In Ankara, in April 2021, I took the armchair. Ursula ended up on the sofa. They called it “Sofagate”. I never really got over it."
end
script vdl_champion
  if flag CHAMPION_DONE goto apres
  call cine_champion
  show R vdl neutral
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "Welcome to the 13th floor. Yes, I live here: there's a little bedroom next to my office. It's handy for urgent files."
  expr R happy
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "President of the Commission since 2019, re-elected in 2024. The Green Deal, the Covid crisis, the vaccines…"
  expr R worried
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "The text messages with Pfizer's boss? In May 2025, the EU General Court annulled our refusal to hand them over to the New York Times. Anyway. Moving on."
  expr R neutral
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "You want the daylight saving directive? Beat me. Team Europe — in the end, there can be only one."
  close
  hide all
  battle vdl
  setflag CHAMPION_DONE
  music ending
  call cine_pantheon
  show R vdl happy
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "Extraordinary. You're the best intern in the history of the Commission. Here it is… the directive ending the clock change."
  giveitem directive_heure
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "All that's left is to get it signed. A formality! All we need is for…"
  hide all
  call powers_arrive
  goto fin
:apres
  show R vdl happy
  if flag GAME_CLEARED goto fini
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "The great powers are waiting! Antwerp, Warsaw, Piraeus… Take the train."
  goto fin
:fini
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "You saved Europe. And the directive is… in committee. As always. Thank you for everything, {P}."
:fin
end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Chapter 11 — Les Grandes Puissances
script powers_arrive
  call cine_puissances
  sfx ALARM
  screenshake 30
  say - "BEEP BEEP BEEP! Three urgent messages arrive at the same time on every phone in the Berlaymont."
  show L trump happy
  say "Donald Trump" "HELLO EUROPE! I have a small request. Very small. I'm putting tariffs on everything. And I'd like to buy Greenland. It's for sale, right?"
  hide L
  say - "Second message, from the East: “The gas tap is turned off. For your own good.” Signed: V. P."
  say - "Third message, very polite: “We are suspending our rare earth exports. Your phones will work… less.” Signed: X. J."
  show R vdl worried
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "{P}, the directive will have to wait. The Great Powers want to bring Europe to heel. We have to go and see them. All three of them."
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "The port of Antwerp, Warsaw, and the port of Piraeus, in Athens. The stations are open to you. Team Europe is counting on you!"
  setflag POWERS_START
  setflag TRAIN_ANVERS
  setflag TRAIN_VARSOVIE
  chapter 11
end

script anvers_rutte
  show R rutte happy
  say "Mark Rutte" "I'm NATO Secretary General. At The Hague summit, in June 2025, we committed to rise towards 5% of GDP for defence, by 2035."
  say "Mark Rutte" "And I called Donald “daddy”. Well. It was a figure of speech. He loved it. Go on, he's on the green."
end
script anvers_vance
  say "JD Vance" "In February 2025, at the Munich Conference, I explained to Europeans what democracy was. They were… surprised."
end
script anvers_trump
  if flag TRUMP_DONE goto fin
  show R trump happy
  say "Donald Trump" "THIS IS THE MOST BEAUTIFUL GOLF COURSE IN THE WORLD. I just bought it. Well, I think so. The port too, maybe."
  say "Donald Trump" "On 2 April 2025, Liberation Day! I held up a big board with tariffs for EVERYBODY. Even for islands where there are only penguins."
  expr R angry
  say "Donald Trump" "In July 2025, at my Turnberry golf course, Ursula and I made a deal: 15%. But I can change my mind. I often change my mind. It's a strategy."
  expr R happy
  say "Donald Trump" "And Greenland! It's big, it's white, it's beautiful. Denmark doesn't want to sell. VERY UNFAIR. We debate, and if I win, I buy it!"
  close
  hide all
  battle trump
  setflag TRUMP_DONE
  show R trump sulk
  say "Donald Trump" "It was rigged. Totally rigged. Fine. We keep 15%. And Greenland stays Danish. For now. I'll post something in capital letters tonight."
  hide all
  call powers_check
:fin
end

script var_tusk
  show R tusk neutral
  say "Donald Tusk" "Welcome to Warsaw. Prime Minister of Poland, former President of the European Council. Here, we know what freedom is worth."
end
script var_zelensky
  show R zelensky neutral
  say "Volodymyr Zelensky" "Since February 2022, my country has been resisting the Russian invasion. Thank you, Europe, for your support. The palace is up there: be careful."
  giveitem repowereu_item
  say "Volodymyr Zelensky" "Take this REPowerEU kit: Europe has learned to do without Russian gas. You'll need it to keep warm in there."
end
script var_putin
  if flag PUTIN_DONE goto fin
  call cine_poutine
  show R putin neutral
  say "Vladimir Putin" "Sit down. No… further away. There. In February 2022, I received presidents at this distance. It's more… comfortable."
  say "Vladimir Putin" "Gas? I turned off the tap. Elections? In December 2024, Romania's Constitutional Court annulled a presidential election amid interference. I don't know what you're talking about."
  say "Vladimir Putin" "Here, your arguments will take a whole turn to reach the other end of the table. Let's begin."
  close
  hide all
  battle putin
  setflag PUTIN_DONE
  show R putin neutral
  say "Vladimir Putin" "…Your REPowerEU kit works. Blackmail doesn't work any more. Leave, before I shorten the table."
  hide all
  call powers_check
:fin
end

script piree_panda
  say "Keeper" "These two pandas are on loan from China to a European zoo. It's called “panda diplomacy”. They eat 40 kg of bamboo a day. The pandas, not the diplomats."
end
script piree_xi
  if flag XI_DONE goto fin
  show R xi neutral
  say "Xi Jinping" "Welcome. Since 2019, the European Union has described us as a partner, a competitor and a systemic rival. Me too, I'm all three."
  say "Xi Jinping" "You tax our electric cars — up to 35% since October 2024. We tax your cognac. And we keep an eye on our rare earths. It's balanced."
  say "Xi Jinping" "In this debate, my Euromon will change type every turn: partner, competitor, rival. Good luck keeping up."
  close
  hide all
  battle xi
  setflag XI_DONE
  show R xi neutral
  say "Xi Jinping" "Hmm. A partner worthy of respect. The rare earths will be on their way again. The pandas stay, they're very popular."
  hide all
  say - "A yellow bear cub walks behind a container. A sign appears: “Content unavailable in your region.”"
  call powers_check
:fin
end

script powers_check
  if !flag TRUMP_DONE goto fin
  if !flag PUTIN_DONE goto fin
  if !flag XI_DONE goto fin
  sfx ALARM
  say - "A message from the President: “The three Great Powers are demanding a summit. Right now. The G-Everything Summit. I'm sending you there.”"
  loading 90
  warp sommet 10 12 up
:fin
end

script sommet_trump
  say "Donald Trump" "IT WAS MY IDEA TO HOLD THIS SUMMIT."
end
script sommet_putin
  say "Vladimir Putin" "The table is too short."
end
script sommet_xi
  say "Xi Jinping" "We are all partners. And rivals."
end

script sommet_final
  if flag GAME_CLEARED goto fin
  music final
  call cine_gtout
  show L trump happy
  show R xi neutral
  focus L
  say "Donald Trump" "Right, shall we start? Me first. Everybody says I'm the best at starting."
  focus R
  say "Xi Jinping" "We propose to begin… after careful consideration. In fifty years."
  hide R
  show R putin neutral
  focus R
  say "Vladimir Putin" "Why is Europe at the table? It was supposed to be on the folding seat."
  focus L
  say "Donald Trump" "THE FOLDING SEAT IS TREMENDOUS. I sell them."
  hide all
  say - "Everyone talks at once. The interpreters give up. Only one solution remains: a debate."
  battle trump_final
  battle putin_final
  battle xi_final
  setflag GAME_CLEARED
  say - "Silence in the room. The three Great Powers look at each other… then they look at Europe."
  call cine_gtout_fin
  show L vdl happy
  say "Ursula von der Leyen" "Team Europe! Together, we are stronger than apart. That's pretty much the whole story of the Union, isn't it?"
  show R schuman happy
  say "Professor Schuman" "Concrete achievements, {P}. De facto solidarity. I said it in 1950. You did it in one internship."
  hide all
  say - "And the directive ending the clock change? It was sent back… to committee."
  say - "But that's another story."
  call cine_fin
  special ending
  setflag POSTGAME
  setflag TRAIN_ROME
  setflag TRAIN_MAASTRICHT
  setflag TRAIN_LISBONNE
  heal
  warp bruxelles 38 26 down
  say - "The adventure continues! New trains now serve Rome, Maastricht and Lisbon. They say legendary Euromons sleep there… And someone is waiting for you at Brussels station."
:fin
end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Post-game
script rome_legend
  if flag LEG_ROMULUS goto fin
  call cine_rome
  say - "An ancient statue, on the Capitol square. On 25 March 1957, six countries signed the Treaty of Rome here. Something is moving…"
  wild romulus 60
  setflag LEG_ROMULUS
:fin
end
script maastricht_legend
  if flag LEG_MAASTRICHT goto fin
  call cine_maastricht
  say - "Here, on 7 February 1992, the Maastricht Treaty gave birth to the European Union. A giant euro coin starts to glow…"
  wild maastrichtor 60
  setflag LEG_MAASTRICHT
:fin
end
script lisbonne_legend
  if flag LEG_LISBONNE goto fin
  call cine_lisbonne
  say - "On 13 December 2007, the Treaty of Lisbon was signed at the Jerónimos Monastery. A translucent figure approaches…"
  wild lisbonia 60
  setflag LEG_LISBONNE
  say - "In the distance, another Euromon flees: Constitutio. Rejected in 2005, it never lets itself be captured."
:fin
end
